{"file": "D:\\SpaceBook\\Books\\6th\\Math\\JPG\\050.jpg", "lines": [{"text": "a)ClosureLaw", "conf": 0.85, "box": [[88, 116], [363, 116], [363, 153], [88, 153]]}, {"text": "closure law of integers under addition.", "conf": 0.921, "box": [[85, 221], [722, 220], [722, 257], [85, 258]]}, {"text": "For example when we add -2 and +7, we get +5.", "conf": 0.915, "box": [[83, 271], [836, 268], [836, 305], [83, 308]]}, {"text": "-2 + (+7) = -2 + 7 = +5", "conf": 0.841, "box": [[84, 327], [460, 323], [460, 359], [84, 364]]}, {"text": "b)CommutativeLaw", "conf": 0.905, "box": [[83, 404], [484, 401], [484, 441], [83, 443]]}, {"text": "known as the commutative law of integers under addition.", "conf": 0.949, "box": [[84, 522], [1033, 515], [1034, 555], [84, 562]]}, {"text": "Let's suppose a and b are any two integers, then:", "conf": 0.922, "box": [[84, 578], [847, 576], [847, 613], [84, 615]]}, {"text": "For example when we add -3 and +5, we get +2.", "conf": 0.896, "box": [[84, 630], [841, 629], [841, 669], [84, 670]]}, {"text": "So, -3 + 5 = +2", "conf": 0.87, "box": [[84, 689], [330, 687], [330, 720], [84, 722]]}, {"text": "Let's change the order of the addends, and add +5 and -3. We get +2", "conf": 0.91, "box": [[84, 741], [1195, 738], [1195, 774], [84, 777]]}, {"text": "5 + (-3 )= 2", "conf": 0.807, "box": [[84, 796], [271, 796], [271, 833], [84, 833]]}, {"text": "Note it down", "conf": 0.806, "box": [[847, 819], [1065, 821], [1064, 854], [847, 852]]}, {"text": "So, -3 + 5 = +5 + (-3) = 2", "conf": 0.867, "box": [[84, 850], [492, 850], [492, 886], [84, 886]]}, {"text": "Commutativeand AssociativeLaws ofintegers", "conf": 0.917, "box": [[849, 877], [1500, 877], [1500, 906], [849, 906]]}, {"text": "It shows that changing the order of a whole", "conf": 0.9, "box": [[83, 902], [764, 904], [764, 942], [83, 940]]}, {"text": "with respectto subtractionare not valid,", "conf": 0.91, "box": [[849, 921], [1411, 921], [1411, 951], [849, 951]]}, {"text": "numbers in addition does not change the sum.", "conf": 0.924, "box": [[85, 957], [812, 962], [812, 997], [85, 992]]}, {"text": "because the difference of two or more integers", "conf": 0.881, "box": [[846, 960], [1511, 964], [1510, 996], [846, 992]]}, {"text": "Let's suppose a and b are any two integers,", "conf": 0.908, "box": [[84, 1005], [756, 1017], [755, 1057], [83, 1045]]}, {"text": "always change, when we change the order of", "conf": 0.892, "box": [[849, 1003], [1482, 1005], [1481, 1038], [849, 1036]]}, {"text": "integers.", "conf": 0.867, "box": [[847, 1045], [972, 1048], [971, 1082], [846, 1079]]}, {"text": "when we add we get:", "conf": 0.887, "box": [[86, 1063], [414, 1067], [414, 1103], [85, 1099]]}, {"text": "a+b=b+a", "conf": 0.831, "box": [[457, 1070], [677, 1073], [676, 1107], [457, 1104]]}, {"text": "This is the generalised form of Commutative Law of integers under addition.", "conf": 0.915, "box": [[87, 1151], [1298, 1168], [1298, 1204], [86, 1187]]}, {"text": "c)Associative Law", "conf": 0.853, "box": [[89, 1200], [432, 1206], [432, 1242], [88, 1237]]}, {"text": "In addition, when we add three integers, the order of grouping the numbers does not affect", "conf": 0.919, "box": [[86, 1245], [1565, 1270], [1564, 1310], [85, 1285]]}, {"text": "the sum. For example grouping the first two integers and adding their sum to the third", "conf": 0.934, "box": [[85, 1297], [1479, 1324], [1478, 1368], [84, 1340]]}, {"text": "integer is the same as grouping the last two numbers and adding their sum to the", "conf": 0.929, "box": [[86, 1351], [1399, 1379], [1398, 1422], [85, 1394]]}, {"text": "first integer.", "conf": 0.897, "box": [[88, 1407], [277, 1413], [276, 1450], [87, 1444]]}, {"text": "Let's verify.", "conf": 0.885, "box": [[86, 1459], [260, 1467], [258, 1504], [85, 1496]]}, {"text": "[(-2 + (+4)] + (-1 )= (-2) + [(4)+ (-1))", "conf": 0.838, "box": [[87, 1519], [675, 1532], [674, 1568], [86, 1555]]}, {"text": "L.H.S =[(-2 + (+4)] + (-1)", "conf": 0.9, "box": [[86, 1580], [474, 1594], [472, 1631], [85, 1617]]}, {"text": "Noteit down", "conf": 0.838, "box": [[884, 1609], [1100, 1620], [1098, 1653], [883, 1642]]}, {"text": "=[(-2 + 4)] + (-1 )", "conf": 0.849, "box": [[174, 1652], [452, 1659], [451, 1695], [173, 1688]]}, {"text": "When we add or subtract any", "conf": 0.88, "box": [[883, 1677], [1290, 1698], [1288, 1731], [882, 1710]]}, {"text": "=+2 + (-1)", "conf": 0.816, "box": [[174, 1715], [356, 1724], [355, 1761], [172, 1752]]}, {"text": "integer from O, we get the", "conf": 0.875, "box": [[882, 1721], [1242, 1738], [1241, 1771], [881, 1754]]}, {"text": "integer itself.", "conf": 0.907, "box": [[882, 1763], [1063, 1771], [1061, 1805], [881, 1797]]}, {"text": "= 2- 1", "conf": 0.677, "box": [[171, 1782], [285, 1787], [284, 1822], [170, 1818]]}, {"text": "= +1", "conf": 0.707, "box": [[172, 1850], [255, 1850], [255, 1889], [172, 1889]]}, {"text": "48", "conf": 0.666, "box": [[751, 2008], [800, 2008], [800, 2045], [751, 2045]]}, {"text": "NOTFORSALE", "conf": 0.79, "box": [[1116, 2027], [1415, 2040], [1413, 2074], [1114, 2061]]}]}